This is an opencode PROFILE (agents, commands, skill) for the VERDICT DFIR
platform. It reuses content and tools from:

- verdict-dfir-community (Apache-2.0) — https://github.com/TimothyVang/verdict-dfir-community
  The forensic doctrine under .opencode/skill/verdict-dfir/reference/ (MEMORY.md,
  GROUNDING.md, JUDGING.md, EXPERT.md, TOOLS.md) and the agent/command prose are
  ported from that project's agent-config/. The findevil-mcp / findevil-agent-mcp
  forensic tool servers are provided by that project (not vendored here).

- verdict-opencode — https://github.com/TimothyVang/verdict-opencode
  The `verdict` agent runtime, a branded fork of opencode (MIT, https://github.com/sst/opencode).
